sequenceDiagram
    %% The on-call path, from page to all-clear.
    accTitle: Incident escalation
    accDescr {
        A failing health check pages the on-call engineer, who acknowledges within
        five minutes or the page escalates to the secondary.
    }
    participant Probe as Health probe    # the /healthz poller, every 10s
    participant Pager
    actor Primary as Primary on-call
    actor Secondary as Secondary on-call

    Probe->>Pager: health check failed 3 times in a row
    Pager->>+Primary: page(sev 2)
    alt acknowledged within 5 minutes
        Primary-->>-Pager: ack
    else no acknowledgement
        Pager->>Secondary: escalate(sev 2)
        Secondary-->>Pager: ack
    end
    Note over Primary,Secondary: The all-clear closes the incident for both
